    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0046",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "电力行业是国民经济基础性、战略性行业，覆盖电力生产、传输、消费以及装备制造、工程建设、科研教育和专业服务等完整产业链。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0046",
        "line_start": 102,
        "line_end": 102
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0047",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "随着新型能源体系和新型电力系统加快建设，电力业务数字化、市场化和智能化程度持续提升，跨主体、跨系统、跨领域的数据协同和专业能力协同需求不断增长。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0046",
        "line_start": 102,
        "line_end": 102
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0048",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "行业需要形成稳定的资源连接、可信使用、产品组织和持续服务基础，推动分散的数据、知识、模型和专业能力转化为可持续供给。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0046",
        "line_start": 102,
        "line_end": 102
      },
      "segment_index": 3
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0049",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "一是业务需求持续增长。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0047",
        "line_start": 104,
        "line_end": 104
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0050",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "新能源大规模接入、电力市场化改革深化以及人工智能与能源电力业务加快融合，对多源数据、专业知识、预测模型、持续监测和智能服务提出更高要求。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0047",
        "line_start": 104,
        "line_end": 104
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0051",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "生产运行、供需平衡、设备管理、交易决策、燃料采购、经营分析、绿色低碳、科研教育等业务，对跨主体资源协同的依赖持续增强。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0047",
        "line_start": 104,
        "line_end": 104
      },
      "segment_index": 3
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0052",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "二是行业资源较为分散。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0048",
        "line_start": 106,
        "line_end": 106
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0053",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "数据、知识、模型、算法和专业能力分布在不同法人主体、业务系统和安全域内，目录标识、数据口径、接口方式、质量标准、授权条件和版本管理尚未完全统一，资源发现、技术适配、合规沟通和持续维护成本较高。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0048",
        "line_start": 106,
        "line_end": 106
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0054",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "复杂业务问题还需要数据资源、模型算法、专家知识、技术实施和持续服务能力共同参与，单一主体内部资源难以完整覆盖。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0048",
        "line_start": 106,
        "line_end": 106
      },
      "segment_index": 3
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0055",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "三是规模化服务机制仍需完善。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0049",
        "line_start": 108,
        "line_end": 108
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0056",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "资源提供方关注控制权、使用用途、成果边界和合理收益，需求方关注质量、交付稳定性、安全责任和服务保障。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0049",
        "line_start": 108,
        "line_end": 108
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0057",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "行业需要进一步完善资源登记、产品封装、授权执行、可信交付、服务计量、客户评价和价值结算机制，形成从资源供给到业务应用、从单项试点到持续运营的完整闭环。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "一、建设背景"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0049",
        "line_start": 108,
        "line_end": 108
      },
      "segment_index": 3
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0058",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "电力领域数据基础设施定位为电力数据要素流通共享的行业中枢和价值释放引擎，通过建设国家数据基础设施电力行业节点、行业数据与专业能力运营平台、多主体协同和价值共创载体，组织行业资源与应用需求高效衔接。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "二、总体定位"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0050",
        "line_start": 112,
        "line_end": 112
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0059",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "一是建设国家数据基础设施电力行业节点。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "二、总体定位"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0051",
        "line_start": 114,
        "line_end": 114
      },
      "segment_index": 1
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "fact-0060",
      "fact_type": "statement",
      "text": "按照国家统一部署，逐步衔接全域功能节点、区域节点、其他行业节点及相关数据流通体系，承担电力行业侧主体连接、目录衔接、接口协同、可信流通和场景承接功能，促进不同主体、不同区域和不同系统之间的资源发现、供需衔接和业务协同。",
      "heading_path": [
        "第一章　建设背景与合作基础",
        "二、总体定位"
      ],
      "claim_status": "source_assertion",
      "verification_status": "unverified",
      "semantic_role": "unclassified",
      "source_ref": {
        "block_id": "blk-0051",
        "line_start": 114,
        "line_end": 114
      },
      "segment_index": 2
    }
